(7512722, 1199553, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome view for a day at the beach!  I like the conversion - works very well in B&amp;W.  I like that there''s so much to see - the dogs on the left, the guy gesturing on the bench.  Looks like it may be an HDR since there''s a ghosted arm and a ghosted dog head, but that''s kinda fun - I don''t mind it at all!</td>', 'Awesome view for a day at the beach!  I like the conversion - works very well in B&W.  I like that there''s so much to see - the dogs on the left, the guy gesturing on the bench.  Looks like it may be an HDR since there''s a ghosted arm and a ghosted dog head, but that''s kinda fun - I don''t mind it at all!', '2017-05-08 23:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512723, 1199521, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sometimes we forget that even though they''re "housecats", they''re still hunters.  that''s the feel I get from this.  I like the bokeh of the grass in the background, too.</td>', 'Sometimes we forget that even though they''re "housecats", they''re still hunters.  that''s the feel I get from this.  I like the bokeh of the grass in the background, too.', '2017-05-08 23:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512724, 1199683, 30982, '<td valign="top">One thing about being old and working on being senile, is I can''t remember crap - I do seem to recall that I did shoot buttons but I don''t think they went into a challenge.  My mom had boxes and boxes of buttons and when she died, my sister and I each took some.  This reminds me that I still have boxes of buttons somewhere and I really ought to do something with them!  Nice collection here, by the way.  And I like the monochrome and the toning, both are very much "me".</td>', 'One thing about being old and working on being senile, is I can''t remember crap - I do seem to recall that I did shoot buttons but I don''t think they went into a challenge.  My mom had boxes and boxes of buttons and when she died, my sister and I each took some.  This reminds me that I still have boxes of buttons somewhere and I really ought to do something with them!  Nice collection here, by the way.  And I like the monochrome and the toning, both are very much "me".', '2017-05-08 23:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512725, 1199514, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture in the bloom.  Texture is one thing that draws my eye.  Very bright and "happy", too - gives off that vibe to me.</td>', 'Lovely texture in the bloom.  Texture is one thing that draws my eye.  Very bright and "happy", too - gives off that vibe to me.', '2017-05-08 23:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512726, 1199499, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the bubbles!  Nice addition to the picture - very nice street candid.  I don''t do as many of these as I used to and I miss it.</td>', 'Love the bubbles!  Nice addition to the picture - very nice street candid.  I don''t do as many of these as I used to and I miss it.', '2017-05-08 23:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512727, 1199361, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome light!  I especially love the bike lane "sharrow" visible on the surface.  You''ve much better skill than I at taking shots while moving.  I''m a right hand shooter and I hate taking that hand off the brake.  Tilt works for me - I like all the lines and arches - well seen!</td>', 'Awesome light!  I especially love the bike lane "sharrow" visible on the surface.  You''ve much better skill than I at taking shots while moving.  I''m a right hand shooter and I hate taking that hand off the brake.  Tilt works for me - I like all the lines and arches - well seen!', '2017-05-08 23:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512728, 1199511, 30982, '<td valign="top">That she does, and she loves "busy", too, which this is.  LOVE that shirt - somehow it goes wonderfully with the paintings!  Looks like a very interesting display - looking forward to hearing a bit more about it, so hopefully you have photographer notes.</td>', 'That she does, and she loves "busy", too, which this is.  LOVE that shirt - somehow it goes wonderfully with the paintings!  Looks like a very interesting display - looking forward to hearing a bit more about it, so hopefully you have photographer notes.', '2017-05-08 23:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512729, 1199169, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do look for stuff like this - I love the play of light and that''s really nice here.  You caught both of your figures in very interesting poses, too, which adds an element of interest, in that they seem very interested in something.  Well seen and very good timing.</td>', 'I do look for stuff like this - I love the play of light and that''s really nice here.  You caught both of your figures in very interesting poses, too, which adds an element of interest, in that they seem very interested in something.  Well seen and very good timing.', '2017-05-08 23:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512730, 1199664, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very southern California with boards (both surf and skate) and the beach.  And looks like a gray day, which we do get here this time of year, and I love.</td>', 'Very southern California with boards (both surf and skate) and the beach.  And looks like a gray day, which we do get here this time of year, and I love.', '2017-05-08 23:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512731, 1199571, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very striking first impression!  The artist''s woman is proud and defiant (to me); the real woman is a bit taken aback, perhaps apprehensive.  Really strong composition - I quite like the balance of the real (kinda small) and the art (kinda dominating).  I probably wouldn''t have done this nearly as well!</td>', 'Very striking first impression!  The artist''s woman is proud and defiant (to me); the real woman is a bit taken aback, perhaps apprehensive.  Really strong composition - I quite like the balance of the real (kinda small) and the art (kinda dominating).  I probably wouldn''t have done this nearly as well!', '2017-05-08 23:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512732, 1199699, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do love shooting cats.  They''re hard, though - they never cooperate when you want them to!  (At least mine do not - a whole lot of trial and error is involved.)  I really like the way the light has caught the whiskers here - very pretty cat!</td>', 'I do love shooting cats.  They''re hard, though - they never cooperate when you want them to!  (At least mine do not - a whole lot of trial and error is involved.)  I really like the way the light has caught the whiskers here - very pretty cat!', '2017-05-08 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512734, 1199641, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do often find "conversations" between things that are inanimate - I like that you saw that here, too.</td>', 'I do often find "conversations" between things that are inanimate - I like that you saw that here, too.', '2017-05-08 23:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512735, 1199627, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, how I miss doing street photography in Europe!  I don''t know that this is Europe but it''s definitely not southern California!  (At least not any southern California I''ve seen.)  Nice balance of your actors, with the building taking center stage but supporting characters playing their part as well.</td>', 'Oh, how I miss doing street photography in Europe!  I don''t know that this is Europe but it''s definitely not southern California!  (At least not any southern California I''ve seen.)  Nice balance of your actors, with the building taking center stage but supporting characters playing their part as well.', '2017-05-08 23:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512736, 1198990, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely street art!  I would guess this might be part of a school project now on display in a public setting somewhere.  A nice find!</td>', 'Lovely street art!  I would guess this might be part of a school project now on display in a public setting somewhere.  A nice find!', '2017-05-08 23:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512737, 1199446, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, that single bird, and all the people so far, far apart from each other.  Wonderful find.  I know your title refers to the gent with the metal detectors, but to me, the true treasure hunter is that bird.</td>', 'Ah, that single bird, and all the people so far, far apart from each other.  Wonderful find.  I know your title refers to the gent with the metal detectors, but to me, the true treasure hunter is that bird.', '2017-05-08 23:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512738, 1199406, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah - made me smile!  Definitely something I''d shoot.  Nice touch with the title (I''m never quite that creative with titles but I try now and then.)  The gent probably isn''t as appreciative as he should be for that tree, who is really the star of the show.</td>', 'Ah - made me smile!  Definitely something I''d shoot.  Nice touch with the title (I''m never quite that creative with titles but I try now and then.)  The gent probably isn''t as appreciative as he should be for that tree, who is really the star of the show.', '2017-05-08 23:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512739, 1199415, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of light and shadow - I like the unassuming nature of it, too - we don''t get her eye, just he lashes.  The whole thing has sort of an incognito vibe going for it, don''t you think?</td>', 'Nice catch of light and shadow - I like the unassuming nature of it, too - we don''t get her eye, just he lashes.  The whole thing has sort of an incognito vibe going for it, don''t you think?', '2017-05-08 23:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512740, 1199598, 30982, '<td valign="top">And how did you know I''m a Stephen King fan?  Very nicely done - love the textures in the ground (particularly the tire tracks in the mud) and the mottled shadows on the wall.  Your gunslinger looks very young and just a bit on the shy side.</td>', 'And how did you know I''m a Stephen King fan?  Very nicely done - love the textures in the ground (particularly the tire tracks in the mud) and the mottled shadows on the wall.  Your gunslinger looks very young and just a bit on the shy side.', '2017-05-08 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512741, 1199704, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kind of shot with lots going on, not the least of which is the car reflected mid-window!  Heck, she almost has my hair, too.</td>', 'My kind of shot with lots going on, not the least of which is the car reflected mid-window!  Heck, she almost has my hair, too.', '2017-05-08 23:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512742, 1199624, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like the softness of the processing, the toning of the colors.  Something I can''t quite do unless I use a preset on my phone.  Great collection of different poses from your birds - they really put on a good show for you here.  I do like this.  There''s a nice gentleness to the scene - quite relaxing!</td>', 'I quite like the softness of the processing, the toning of the colors.  Something I can''t quite do unless I use a preset on my phone.  Great collection of different poses from your birds - they really put on a good show for you here.  I do like this.  There''s a nice gentleness to the scene - quite relaxing!', '2017-05-08 23:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512745, 1199404, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of freedom and happiness here - a very good "in the moment" capture!</td>', 'Nice sense of freedom and happiness here - a very good "in the moment" capture!', '2017-05-08 23:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512746, 1199532, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I do like finding patterns in things and bikes are one of those things I especially like.  I also quite like the toning you chose, and the wide presentation.  Quite fits my style.</td>', 'Nice!  I do like finding patterns in things and bikes are one of those things I especially like.  I also quite like the toning you chose, and the wide presentation.  Quite fits my style.', '2017-05-08 23:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512747, 1199626, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I think I did shoot this thing or something similar, when it stopped by where I worked one day.  Quite odd-looking, isn''t it?</td>', 'Ha!  I think I did shoot this thing or something similar, when it stopped by where I worked one day.  Quite odd-looking, isn''t it?', '2017-05-08 23:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512748, 1199502, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field and bokeh - I try for this with lavender from time to time, and I shoot flowers more than people think.  I''m just not all that good at it!</td>', 'Nice depth of field and bokeh - I try for this with lavender from time to time, and I shoot flowers more than people think.  I''m just not all that good at it!', '2017-05-08 23:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512750, 1199618, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  WAY better than I could do!  I like how you saw/are showing us the echo of the curves.  Really nicely seen, gorgeous tones and processing.</td>', 'Beautifully done!  WAY better than I could do!  I like how you saw/are showing us the echo of the curves.  Really nicely seen, gorgeous tones and processing.', '2017-05-08 23:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512751, 1199703, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great catch!  So many fun things to visit here - center being the dog and the two youngest kids, but there''s also the other groups on the dock, and bikes parked out there, and sailboats...Good composition, nice conversion!</td>', 'Great catch!  So many fun things to visit here - center being the dog and the two youngest kids, but there''s also the other groups on the dock, and bikes parked out there, and sailboats...Good composition, nice conversion!', '2017-05-09 00:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512752, 1199430, 30982, '<td valign="top">Man, the crispness of those talons, those eyes... WAY better than I can do with birds!  I''m not all that good catching them in the air - beyond my skillset and my lens range, I''m afraid!  Excellent capture.</td>', 'Man, the crispness of those talons, those eyes... WAY better than I can do with birds!  I''m not all that good catching them in the air - beyond my skillset and my lens range, I''m afraid!  Excellent capture.', '2017-05-09 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512753, 1199648, 30982, '<td valign="top">It very well could be, it''s my kind of shot.  So may layers!  Well seen.</td>', 'It very well could be, it''s my kind of shot.  So may layers!  Well seen.', '2017-05-09 00:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
