(7512773, 1199652, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  What a wonderful view!  That solitary bird makes the shot.  You''re definitely more skilled at using processing to bring out the photograph you want than I am.  Well done.</td>', 'Oh my!  What a wonderful view!  That solitary bird makes the shot.  You''re definitely more skilled at using processing to bring out the photograph you want than I am.  Well done.', '2017-05-09 01:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
