(7512779, 1199526, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now if the darn pigeon would JUST SHOW UP!  I had this very same problem, though not with this view.  Pelicans and pigeons seemed a bit camera-shy during the time this challenge was open - go figure!  Your use of trees as the presenters of your photograph is very much something I would do.  Probably not something the landscape photograpers would want us to do, but hey, I like it just fine.</td>', 'Now if the darn pigeon would JUST SHOW UP!  I had this very same problem, though not with this view.  Pelicans and pigeons seemed a bit camera-shy during the time this challenge was open - go figure!  Your use of trees as the presenters of your photograph is very much something I would do.  Probably not something the landscape photograpers would want us to do, but hey, I like it just fine.', '2017-05-09 01:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
