(7512907, 1199694, 170018, '<td valign="top">Love the grain!</td>', 'Love the grain!', '2017-05-09 18:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512916, 1199656, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s a sense of both known and unknown here - I don''t usually manage to pull that off, but that doesn''t mean I don''t try on occasion!</td>', 'There''s a sense of both known and unknown here - I don''t usually manage to pull that off, but that doesn''t mean I don''t try on occasion!', '2017-05-09 20:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512917, 1199320, 30982, '<td valign="top">That poor gerbera has seen better days, but I like the texture of the peeling poster.  I also like the apparent graffiti on the sign next to it, too.</td>', 'That poor gerbera has seen better days, but I like the texture of the peeling poster.  I also like the apparent graffiti on the sign next to it, too.', '2017-05-09 20:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512918, 1199632, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks to me like Leo is quite taken with the view of the ocean - this is something I can understand.  I never tire of it.  (And you do have me wondering what the rest of his shirt says.)</td>', 'Looks to me like Leo is quite taken with the view of the ocean - this is something I can understand.  I never tire of it.  (And you do have me wondering what the rest of his shirt says.)', '2017-05-09 20:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512919, 1199503, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you know this gent, but the picture - your composition, your presentation, your view - is just a bit creepy!  There''s a sense of confinement - the overlay of the tree branches every where, the cage behind which he stands, his hands, not quite resting on whatever the ledge of the cage is.  Quite the story you''ve found here.</td>', 'I don''t know if you know this gent, but the picture - your composition, your presentation, your view - is just a bit creepy!  There''s a sense of confinement - the overlay of the tree branches every where, the cage behind which he stands, his hands, not quite resting on whatever the ledge of the cage is.  Quite the story you''ve found here.', '2017-05-09 20:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512920, 1199613, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the splashes of color and the wee bits of reflection in the water''s edge - that''s something I enjoy when I wander to the beach with my camera is checking out the reflections as the water runs back across the sand.</td>', 'I like the splashes of color and the wee bits of reflection in the water''s edge - that''s something I enjoy when I wander to the beach with my camera is checking out the reflections as the water runs back across the sand.', '2017-05-09 20:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512921, 1199574, 30982, '<td valign="top">A different sort of pier than the one on which I watch fishermen, but the fisherman is quite similar - I think they often are.</td>', 'A different sort of pier than the one on which I watch fishermen, but the fisherman is quite similar - I think they often are.', '2017-05-09 20:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512922, 1199468, 30982, '<td valign="top">A wonderful beach shot!  That bright light on the water is something I enjoy shooting into - the way it creates such strong contrast.  And that seagull, stage right - definitely something I''d include!!</td>', 'A wonderful beach shot!  That bright light on the water is something I enjoy shooting into - the way it creates such strong contrast.  And that seagull, stage right - definitely something I''d include!!', '2017-05-09 20:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512924, 1199611, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing where they''ll try to fit, isn''t it?  Such proprietors of space, they think the house and everything in it belongs to them.  I do so enjoy chasing my poor cats with a camera - not sure they enjoy it as much.  Your model seems resigned to cooperating this day - she''s such a gorgeous model!</td>', 'It''s amazing where they''ll try to fit, isn''t it?  Such proprietors of space, they think the house and everything in it belongs to them.  I do so enjoy chasing my poor cats with a camera - not sure they enjoy it as much.  Your model seems resigned to cooperating this day - she''s such a gorgeous model!', '2017-05-09 20:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512925, 1199544, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well spotted and very nicely composed - the light is really quite nice here, too.  Something I''d see and shoot for sure!</td>', 'Well spotted and very nicely composed - the light is really quite nice here, too.  Something I''d see and shoot for sure!', '2017-05-09 20:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512926, 1199636, 30982, '<td valign="top">What lovely color in such delicate structures!  Reminds me of shooting glass in one of the Vegas hotels a long time ago - this is much prettier!</td>', 'What lovely color in such delicate structures!  Reminds me of shooting glass in one of the Vegas hotels a long time ago - this is much prettier!', '2017-05-09 20:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512927, 1199696, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great find!  A nice symbolic conversation here.  Very well spotted and I like the almost Polaroid''ish presentation.</td>', 'What a great find!  A nice symbolic conversation here.  Very well spotted and I like the almost Polaroid''ish presentation.', '2017-05-09 20:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512928, 1199630, 30982, '<td valign="top">At first I thought she had a sword, but then realized it''s a reflector, yes?  I prefer to think of it as a sword anyway.  I like all the different characters here - reminds me of a shot in Germany where I shot another photographer shooting a subject.  Best part here is the foot heading out of frame on the right.</td>', 'At first I thought she had a sword, but then realized it''s a reflector, yes?  I prefer to think of it as a sword anyway.  I like all the different characters here - reminds me of a shot in Germany where I shot another photographer shooting a subject.  Best part here is the foot heading out of frame on the right.', '2017-05-09 20:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512929, 1199548, 30982, '<td valign="top">She looks so lost in all that texture - very aptly titled, as there''s a bit of sadness here, both from the smallness of the girl and the dark toning.</td>', 'She looks so lost in all that texture - very aptly titled, as there''s a bit of sadness here, both from the smallness of the girl and the dark toning.', '2017-05-09 20:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512930, 1199694, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely collection of texture, noise, and serenity if that makes sense.  There''s a very nice flow to this - not clean and crisp, but real and somehow more satisfying.</td>', 'A lovely collection of texture, noise, and serenity if that makes sense.  There''s a very nice flow to this - not clean and crisp, but real and somehow more satisfying.', '2017-05-09 20:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512931, 1199695, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kind of reminds me of my gent in blue in a Starbucks in Frankfurt, but far more carefully cultivated and presented.  Nice sense of mystery.</td>', 'Kind of reminds me of my gent in blue in a Starbucks in Frankfurt, but far more carefully cultivated and presented.  Nice sense of mystery.', '2017-05-09 20:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512932, 1199223, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well hello!  Sweet capture - great light, very nice detail.  And they do seem to be giving you the eye, each in their own way.  They definitely have personality!</td>', 'Well hello!  Sweet capture - great light, very nice detail.  And they do seem to be giving you the eye, each in their own way.  They definitely have personality!', '2017-05-09 20:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512933, 1199653, 30982, '<td valign="top">I wonder the story behind this.  In the US, around here, if someone is killed while riding a bike, there''s a group of volunteers who take an old bicycle, spray paint it all white, and put it up at the site of the accident - they''re called ghost bikes.  I''m hoping this is something different, that someone just decided it would be fun to spray paint their entire bike!</td>', 'I wonder the story behind this.  In the US, around here, if someone is killed while riding a bike, there''s a group of volunteers who take an old bicycle, spray paint it all white, and put it up at the site of the accident - they''re called ghost bikes.  I''m hoping this is something different, that someone just decided it would be fun to spray paint their entire bike!', '2017-05-09 20:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512934, 1199420, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Definitely one of the best titles!  I do enjoy street shooting - looks like a farmer''s market or a festival of some kind.</td>', 'Ha!  Definitely one of the best titles!  I do enjoy street shooting - looks like a farmer''s market or a festival of some kind.', '2017-05-09 20:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512956, 1199705, 30982, '<td valign="top">Made me smile!!  The stripes - all those stripes!  This would make PennyStreet happy (she''s good at stripes) but it''s also "me" in that it''s a wonderful wide view with stories galore, not the least of which is that butt in the center.  The young patron seems less than impressed, however.  The low angle, the B&amp;W, the wide view, the characters everywhere - very me indeed.</td>', 'Made me smile!!  The stripes - all those stripes!  This would make PennyStreet happy (she''s good at stripes) but it''s also "me" in that it''s a wonderful wide view with stories galore, not the least of which is that butt in the center.  The young patron seems less than impressed, however.  The low angle, the B&W, the wide view, the characters everywhere - very me indeed.', '2017-05-10 00:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512957, 1199678, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh too fun!!!  Car show, ducks/geese, full sun.  You get the feeling they''ve seen what they came for and are heading out for lunch.  My kinda thing, truly.  Made me laugh out loud when it popped up.</td>', 'Oh too fun!!!  Car show, ducks/geese, full sun.  You get the feeling they''ve seen what they came for and are heading out for lunch.  My kinda thing, truly.  Made me laugh out loud when it popped up.', '2017-05-10 00:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512958, 1199693, 30982, '<td valign="top">Timing is everything.  His arms, the birds wings.... just doesn''t get any better!  And you did get the shadow, too.  Wonderfully busy is a good way.  Great capture.  Aren''t you glad I took you there?</td>', 'Timing is everything.  His arms, the birds wings.... just doesn''t get any better!  And you did get the shadow, too.  Wonderfully busy is a good way.  Great capture.  Aren''t you glad I took you there?', '2017-05-10 00:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512961, 1199612, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely my kind of shot!  Cats, light and shadow, and the overhead view - all my cup of tea.  This is very well seen and rendered!  Oh, and also love all the patterns.</td>', 'Definitely my kind of shot!  Cats, light and shadow, and the overhead view - all my cup of tea.  This is very well seen and rendered!  Oh, and also love all the patterns.', '2017-05-10 01:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513039, 1199695, 38032, '<td valign="top">Very Coo7 !</td>', 'Very Coo7 !', '2017-05-10 11:49:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7513087, 1199616, 83313, '<td valign="top">One of the entries that I think could be the real one from Deb.</td>', 'One of the entries that I think could be the real one from Deb.', '2017-05-10 23:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513088, 1199503, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit creepy. I think that may be your intention.</td>', 'A bit creepy. I think that may be your intention.', '2017-05-10 23:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513120, 1199420, 28742, '<td valign="top">Weird, I have those same pants. This image suffers in overall technical quality. Does that make it more Melethia? Naw. Still, the scene is eclectic, and that''s a Deb trait. It''s a 7 from me.</td>', 'Weird, I have those same pants. This image suffers in overall technical quality. Does that make it more Melethia? Naw. Still, the scene is eclectic, and that''s a Deb trait. It''s a 7 from me.', '2017-05-11 06:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513121, 1199571, 28742, '<td valign="top">And she heard three voices say "just keep walkin". :P<br/>This is a top notch quality photo and one that I''ve spent the most time looking at. It''s quirky and feels like it should be awkward to look at, but it''s not. Very well done. How Melethia is it? All things considered, it''s good enough for an <strike>8</strike> <b>9</b> from me.</td>', 'And she heard three voices say "just keep walkin". :PThis is a top notch quality photo and one that I''ve spent the most time looking at. It''s quirky and feels like it should be awkward to look at, but it''s not. Very well done. How Melethia is it? All things considered, it''s good enough for an 8 9 from me.', '2017-05-11 06:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513123, 1199693, 28742, '<td valign="top">A signature Melethia scene. Well found and well delivered. 8</td>', 'A signature Melethia scene. Well found and well delivered. 8', '2017-05-11 06:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513124, 1199630, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow! On the right edge, we have a woman scurrying out of the frame. In the crosswalk, someone''s late for work. On the left edge, a burglar makes his escape with his newly acquired flat screen TV. And the main entree is the girl making that guy jump through a hoop before he can pick up his backpack and move on while the photographer is hoping for a spectacular fail shot of the action. <br/> <br/>I left a lot of stories out, but it''s late. You''ve done well to ignite my imagination. 9 for your trouble.</td>', 'Wow! On the right edge, we have a woman scurrying out of the frame. In the crosswalk, someone''s late for work. On the left edge, a burglar makes his escape with his newly acquired flat screen TV. And the main entree is the girl making that guy jump through a hoop before he can pick up his backpack and move on while the photographer is hoping for a spectacular fail shot of the action.  I left a lot of stories out, but it''s late. You''ve done well to ignite my imagination. 9 for your trouble.', '2017-05-11 06:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513126, 1199089, 28742, '<td valign="top">Deb hates cats. ...oh wait, that''s me. Deb loves ''em. She''ll love this one, so I can''t hate it. Damn, look at the dilemma you''ve caused me! Take your 7 and leave me in peace.</td>', 'Deb hates cats. ...oh wait, that''s me. Deb loves ''em. She''ll love this one, so I can''t hate it. Damn, look at the dilemma you''ve caused me! Take your 7 and leave me in peace.', '2017-05-11 06:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513128, 1199511, 28742, '<td valign="top">Weird. 7</td>', 'Weird. 7', '2017-05-11 06:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513129, 1199446, 28742, '<td valign="top">Solidly good in all categories. I''d give you a 6, but all I''ve got is a 7 so just keep the change. :)</td>', 'Solidly good in all categories. I''d give you a 6, but all I''ve got is a 7 so just keep the change. :)', '2017-05-11 06:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513131, 1199636, 28742, '<td valign="top">Deb would''ve converted to BW. :P :)</td>', 'Deb would''ve converted to BW. :P :)', '2017-05-11 06:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513132, 1199526, 28742, '<td valign="top">Is Mr. Pigeon''s first name Waldo?</td>', 'Is Mr. Pigeon''s first name Waldo?', '2017-05-11 06:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513133, 1199696, 28742, '<td valign="top">It''s an impossible love story. You know, because they''re both stuck in the ground at a considerable distance from each other. :P :)</td>', 'It''s an impossible love story. You know, because they''re both stuck in the ground at a considerable distance from each other. :P :)', '2017-05-11 06:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513134, 1199699, 28742, '<td valign="top">This is a contemplative cat. Like someone just informed him he''ll never be as good as a dog. :P :)</td>', 'This is a contemplative cat. Like someone just informed him he''ll never be as good as a dog. :P :)', '2017-05-11 06:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513136, 1199678, 28742, '<td valign="top">While the viewer ponders the gang of web-footed wet birds, he fails to notice that he has been transported back in time.</td>', 'While the viewer ponders the gang of web-footed wet birds, he fails to notice that he has been transported back in time.', '2017-05-11 06:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513137, 1199503, 28742, '<td valign="top">I recently saw a documentary about a serial killer and the last photo taken of one of his victims - a photo taken by the killer - at a location that looked very similar to this one. Buuuut I''m sure you have a solid alibi. :P :)</td>', 'I recently saw a documentary about a serial killer and the last photo taken of one of his victims - a photo taken by the killer - at a location that looked very similar to this one. Buuuut I''m sure you have a solid alibi. :P :)', '2017-05-11 06:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513138, 1199578, 28742, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty clean, I''ll say that much!</td>', 'It''s pretty clean, I''ll say that much!', '2017-05-11 06:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7513139, 1199598, 28742, '<td valign="top">This town ain''t big enough for... those legs! :)</td>', 'This town ain''t big enough for... those legs! :)', '2017-05-11 06:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
