(7513320, 1199703, 38032, '<td valign="top">this is my pick for Melethia. I like the shoe on the right =)<br/> <br/>I take that back. This has too much HDR to it. I think Deb would likely live with a shadowy mystery to her shot. However, I do think this is well done! =))<br/> <br/>OK - I''m back on board. You went all-in this challenge. It has been fun stalking You / Deb.</td>', 'this is my pick for Melethia. I like the shoe on the right =) I take that back. This has too much HDR to it. I think Deb would likely live with a shadowy mystery to her shot. However, I do think this is well done! =)) OK - I''m back on board. You went all-in this challenge. It has been fun stalking You / Deb.', '2017-05-12 10:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
