(7513864, 1199616, 30214, '<td valign="top">based on my projection you should have been in my place. Still I was close. Congratulations on being you!</td>', 'based on my projection you should have been in my place. Still I was close. Congratulations on being you!', '2017-05-15 03:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
